    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="66c9d317-f678-57cf-9852-894395e70191" activityNameId="0a64deff-4c55-5bcf-b8d1-174ef0e2a979" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Roof tile, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Roof tile, at plant
Not included: charge of the wastewater and solid waste. It's assumed that the waste heat is totally reused for drying. No hard coal coke is used by any of these 12 plants. In order to obtain "impermeable" tiles, no media is included which may make it porous (as made for bricks). Not included is the use of engobe to colour the tiles.;
UUID: 7a6c38f5-5f04-31bc-a476-3a41ef307303
includes first ginding process, wet process (includes second ginding, mixing and plastifying), storage, forming (compression molding method) and cutting, drying, firing, loading, packing and storage.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Mix of different technologies (different firing fuels) in A, D, CH. Share of heavy oil to natural gas about 20% to 80%
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: &lt;null&gt;
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_7a6c38f5-5f04-31bc-a476-3a41ef307303.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
